note FizzBuzz in Jesun.Code: plain-English loops and decisions.

count is 1
repeat 20 times
    if count % 15 is 0 then
        show "FizzBuzz"
    otherwise if count % 3 is 0 then
        show "Fizz"
    otherwise if count % 5 is 0 then
        show "Buzz"
    otherwise
        show count
    count is count + 1
